class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55773, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01DAYPncTtyCVZNhysaQzEGP", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 57921, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01CgagcWtXrr3rVAQgxedVTp", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 58221, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01CgagcWtXrr3rVAQgxedVTp", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 58221, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01CgagcWtXrr3rVAQgxedVTp", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62368, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all three regions and passing health checks. The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback**\n- v2.3.1 was failing in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an error rate of about 18%. The latest release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0, so I rolled back to it.\n- The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I ran the same rollback again and it finished in all regions.\n- The error rate is now about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- The incident request timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created, so I didn't open a second one or page the on-call engineer twice.\n- It describes the failure and the rollback, and lists two follow-ups:\n  - Find out why v2.3.1 failed. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was already unhealthy in staging before it was released to production.\n  - Look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content